    <node id="act_poe1_act6">
      <data key="d1">Act 6: The Rising Tide</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">act</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Sixth act and start of Part Two. After failing to stop Kitava's reawakening the exile flees Oriath and returns to Wraeclast, guided by Sin, who plans to harvest souls for a Dark Ember; the exile faces Tukohama, Abberath, Ryslatha and the Brine King. Town: Lioneye's Watch; monster levels 45-50.</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe1"]</data>
      <data key="d6">meta</data>
      <data key="d7">[]</data>
      <data key="d8">poe1_campaign</data>
