    <node id="act_poe1_act9">
      <data key="d1">Act 9: Reunion</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">act</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Ninth act. The exile returns to Highgate, whose waters run red with the dead Beast's blood; Sin's plan is to wake a Dark Ember from the Beast's corpse. Kira/Garukhan, Shakari and the Depraved Trinity are faced. Monster levels 61-64.</data>
