    <node id="act_poe1_epilogue">
      <data key="d1">Epilogue</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">act</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">The post-campaign epilogue: after Kitava's death Lilly Roth offers to sail the exile away ('Toward the Future'); the exile arrives in Karui Shores, where Helena and Commander Kirac introduce the Atlas of Worlds. Earlier versions of the Epilogue were set in rebuilding Oriath.</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe1"]</data>
      <data key="d6">meta</data>
