    <node id="artifact_precursor_weapon">
      <data key="d1">Precursor Weapon</data>
      <data key="d2">["Precursor Weapon", "Precursor Weapon (Weapon in pieces)", "Precursor anti-corruption weapon", "The Weapon (Precursor Weapon)", "The Weapon (instrument of the Third Edict)", "the Weapon"]</data>
      <data key="d3">artifact</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Device built by the Precursors against corruption; Doryani sought to harness it (a lore video says it was scattered by 400 BIC, Doryani holding one piece and three in the Karui archipelago). In PoE2 Act 4 the Exile hunts its three pieces in Ngamakanui; in the endgame only the Hooded One is said able to wield it against the Beast.</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d6">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d7">[]</data>
      <data key="d8">precursor</data>
      <data key="d9">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": null, "story_order": null}</data>
