      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Rune-forged Kalguuran relic honouring Aldur; made a symbol of royal authority under Cadigan I; carried on the first Wraeclast expedition to purify poisoned rain/fish and raise a starlight barrier; stolen by Olroth and later destroyed in the exile's fight with him.</data>
