    <node id="char_ailith">
      <data key="d1">Ailith, First of the Keepers</data>
      <data key="d2">["Ailith"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Founder/leader of the Keepers of the Flame (Order of the Purple Flame) in the Monastery; in PoE1 3.27/3.28 she enlists the Exile against the Hiveborn at the Coast (Act 6), gives the Exile the flame to burn Hiveborn barriers and destroys Fortified Breaches. Author of The Word of the Dreamer. Revealed (Keepers league) to have died long ago: the Dreamer preserved her essence and keeps copies of her, burning and replacing her when she learns this. Also in PoE2.</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d6">branch</data>
      <data key="d7">["breach", "keepers_of_the_flame"]</data>
      <data key="d8">poe1_leagues</data>
      <data key="d9">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": null, "story_order": null}</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
      <data key="d11">canon</data>
      <data key="d12">medium</data>
      <data key="d13">[{"source_id": "src_poewiki_into_the_breach", "locator": "Talk to Ailith; summon Ailith to destroy Fortified Breach"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_the_word_of_the_dreamer", "locator": "written by Ailith, First of the Keepers"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_the_dreamer_npc_", "locator": "Dialogue \"Enter Back Room\": \"you died, long ago. I preserved your essence.\""}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_the_dreamer", "locator": "Lore: Ailith founded the Order after visions; clone/preserved essence"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_keepers_league", "locator": "League content"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_gifts_for_the_genesis_tree", "locator": "Ailith quotes"}, {"source_id": "src_web_gamedeveloper_return_of_the_ancients", "locator": "Characters: Ailith"}, {"source_id": "src_web_domistae_poe2_endgame_guide", "locator": "Alith/Ailith spelled both ways"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_the_dreamer", "locator": "Lore: Ailith founded the Order; she is a copy the Dreamer keeps; PoE2 version aware of her nature"}, {"source_id": "src_ggg_content_update_0_5_0", "locator": "Sky Hives: defend Ailith while she closes the domain"}]</data>
      <data key="d14">["leagues_early", "leagues_late", "poe2_endgame"]</data>
      <data key="d15">["poe1_leagues", "poe2_endgame"]</data>
      <data key="d16">["branch"]</data>
      <data key="d25">[{"domain": "leagues_late", "summary": "Leader of the Keepers; tends the Genesis Tree at the Monastery, receives dream warnings, and guides the Exile to graft Breach flesh onto themselves."}, {"domain": "poe2_endgame", "summary": "Founder of the Order of the Purple Flame / Keepers of the Flame after visions of the Dreamer (PoE1 Keepers); in PoE2 0.5 she leads the Breach questline against the Hiveborn, defends the Sky Hive domain closure and is a preserved essence/copy kept by the Dreamer, who has become somewhat self-aware. 'Alith' is a guide misspelling."}]</data>
