      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Perandus who rigged the Lord's Labyrinth, poisoned the Ezomyte slave Weylin, and became Emperor in 1319 IC. Brutal, vain, ruled with Malachai's gemling thaumatocracy; killed by Ondar at the Night of a Thousand Ribbons in 1334 IC.</data>
