      <data key="d1">Eagon Caeserius</data>
      <data key="d2">["Eagon"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Scholar and Atlas researcher who claims Zana as his sister and Valdo as father; chases the Originator's memory threads with the exile via Memory Tears and Astrolabes. Hints that his parentage is uncertain ('If I am not Valdo's bastard...'); his identity is a community mystery.</data>
