      <data key="d2">["Elder", "Uber Elder"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d24">eldritch_horror_servant_of_decay</data>
      <data key="d4">Entity of malignant madness and servant of the Decay that preyed on children, feeding on their nightmares and later on Valdo's memories. Released by Venarius, it hunted the Atlas until the exile and Zana expelled it with the Cosmic Arcana; a memory of it remains as a pinnacle boss (Uber Elder).</data>
