      <data key="d24">protagonist</data>
      <data key="d4">The player's character in PoE1: a convict sentenced to Wraeclast by High Templar Dominus in 1599-1600 IC. The character washes up on the Twilight Strand, escapes a Templar boat, and fights through Acts 1-10 (defeating Dominus in Act 3, Voll's remains in Act 4, High Templar Avarius and Innocence in Act 5, and Kitava in Act 10 with Sin) and the Atlas storylines.</data>
