      <data key="d25">[{"domain": "leagues_early", "summary": "Niece of King Kaom; trained in archery at Thebrus and led Karui women archers in the ambush that defeated Marceus Lioneye at Lioneye's Watch (Purity Rebellion). After Kaom's corruption she led 500 Karui families home to Ngamakanui, became queen, had a child with Victario, then vanished leading an army against an unknown threat; succeeded by Ahuana. General of the Karui legion in Legion league (3.7.0)."}, {"domain": "poe1_acts_1_5", "summary": "Kaom's niece; led the bow-women whose arrows surprised Lioneye and succeeded Kaom as Karui queen after he left."}]</data>
