    <node id="char_kirac">
      <data key="d1">Commander Kirac</data>
      <data key="d2">["Kirac", "Officer Kirac"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Tracker and officer of Oriath's volunteer Citizen Vanguard, later Commander; younger brother of Baran. In legacy epilogue quests he asked the Exile to find Baran, who had fallen in with 'radical' Zana Caeserius. Sits in the Karui Shores War Room, issues maps, pinnacle invitations and Atlas Books of Skill, calls the Exile 'Godslayer' and backs the Maven as 'the best of our terrible options'. Took Sirus's blow meant for Zana. His dialogue says the Maven resurrects Baran for her games.</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe1"]</data>
      <data key="d6">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d7">[]</data>
      <data key="d8">poe1_campaign</data>
      <data key="d9">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": null, "story_order": null}</data>
      <data key="d10">["poe1_epilogue"]</data>
      <data key="d11">canon</data>
      <data key="d12">high</data>
      <data key="d13">[{"source_id": "src_poewiki_picking_up_the_pieces", "locator": "Kirac dialogue"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_a_call_to_arms", "locator": "Karui Shores: Helena directs the player to Commander Kirac in the War Room, who gives a Tier 1 map"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_a_call_to_arms", "locator": "objective: commissioned by Kirac"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_history_of_wraeclast", "locator": "Sirus: 'Kirac was Baran's brother'"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_atlas_book_of_skill", "locator": "obtained from Kirac or Eagon"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_picking_up_the_pieces", "locator": "quote: 'My younger brother, Baran, fell in with a radical by the name of Zana Caeserius'"}, {"source_id": "src_poedb_commander_kirac", "locator": "KiracOnBaranResurrectionTwo; Introduction: 'tracker and officer in Oriath's new Citizen Vanguard'"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_the_searing_exarch_quest", "locator": "Kirac: 'She's the best of our terrible options'"}]</data>
      <data key="d14">["poe1_acts_6_10", "poe1_atlas"]</data>
      <data key="d15">["poe1_campaign", "poe1_atlas"]</data>
      <data key="d16">["main_plot", "endgame_plot"]</data>
      <data key="d25">[{"domain": "poe1_acts_6_10", "summary": "Oriath officer. In the older Epilogue (v3.9-3.16, 'Picking Up the Pieces', now removed) Officer Kirac sends the exile to the Templar Laboratory to find his brother Baran and learn about Zana; in the current Epilogue Commander Kirac waits in the War Room at Karui Shores and hands the exile the first Map (A Call to Arms)."}]</data>
