    <node id="char_maxarius">
      <data key="d1">Maxarius</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d24">first_high_templar</data>
      <data key="d4">Per the Sanctum relic texts (as recounted in the wiki and video), Maxarius, the first High Templar, was in truth Innocence himself - a charlatan who stole the Descry symbol from fire-terrified newcomers, used their fear, and vilified his brother Sin to ascend.</data>
