    <node id="char_the_arbiter_of_ash">
      <data key="d1">The Arbiter of Ash</data>
      <data key="d2">["Arbiter of Ash", "Guardian of the Flame Seed"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d24">pinnacle_boss</data>
      <data key="d4">Guardian of the Flame Seed, created by the Precursors (PoE wiki, History of Wraeclast; the PoE2 wiki says the Unblinking Eye most likely subjugated it originally, which is speculative). Sealed at the Burning Monolith; fought by the Exile as PoE2's first Atlas pinnacle (0.1-0.4) and as a Fortress quest boss in 0.5, after which a wyrm-rider (Tecrod) steals the Flame Seed. Little else is known.</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d6">endgame_plot</data>
      <data key="d7">[]</data>
