      <data key="d4">Victario 'Vic' Vox, one of the two Vox twin bosses of the Heist unique contract 'Contract: The Twins'. Member of the Vox family, descendant of Cardinal Sanctus Vox, named after the poet Victario. After Kurai steals the book 'O' Eternal' for a client he declares war on her, kidnaps and kills her cat Hana, and is killed with his twin by Kurai and the Exile.</data>
