    <node id="char_zana">
      <data key="d1">Zana, Master Cartographer</data>
      <data key="d2">["Master Cartographer", "Zana"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Forsaken master (Master Cartographer) who survives Betrayal. The wiki has a separate page for Zana Caeserius 'the Originator' of Secrets of the Atlas; the Master page is linked as 'the former Master', implying the same person, but the identity is not spelled out here. Owned by another domain.</data>
