      <data key="d16">["main_plot", "endgame_plot"]</data>
      <data key="d25">[{"domain": "poe1_acts_6_10", "summary": "Master cartographer. In the older Epilogue Kirac blames 'Zana Caeserius' for the disappearance of his brother Baran, and in the Epilogue quest 'Brave New Worlds' (v3.1, since marked historical) Zana gives maps through portals; she belongs mainly to the Atlas/Master storylines of other domains."}, {"domain": "poe1_atlas", "summary": "Valdo's daughter. Orphaned, she fled Oriath before exile, found a Map Device in ruined Oriath and mapped the Atlas. She hunted the Shaper and Elder, hired the Elderslayers, sealed the device when they went mad and left the Atlas after Sirus burned Oriath."}]</data>
      <data key="d18">released</data>
