    <node id="char_zana_the_originator">
      <data key="d1">Zana, the Originator</data>
      <data key="d2">["The Originator", "Zana Caeserius"]</data>
      <data key="d3">character</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Secrets of the Atlas NPC (also Zana Caeserius) who threads memories across the Atlas, working to destroy the Atlas, fracturing it into four quadrants. Nature uncertain: she declares 'I am not your sister' to Eagon, and her relation to the Zana of the Elderslayers era is not spelled out.</data>
