      <data key="d4">PoE1 Ascendancy class for the Ranger. Unlocked by first completing the Lord's Labyrinth and touching the Altar of Ascendancy in its treasure room; spent Ascendancy points unlock its passive tree.</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe1"]</data>
      <data key="d6">meta</data>
      <data key="d7">["labyrinth"]</data>
      <data key="d8">poe1_campaign</data>
