    <node id="concept_blight">
      <data key="d1">Blight (fungal growth)</data>
      <data key="d2">["Blight", "Blight fungus"]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Fungal growths infesting Wraeclast whose mycelium spawns monster waves once a Purification Pump pierces it. Cassia first thought it a symptom of Wraeclast's death, then a parasite, and suspects a central growth that Blighted maps lead to.</data>
