    <node id="concept_cleansing_fire">
      <data key="d1">The Cleansing Fire</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Cosmic force: sentient neural network of suns and black stars seeking omniscience by disintegrating what it studies; served by the Black Star and the Searing Exarch. Its all-seeing-eye symbol resembles the descry and may be origin of Templar religion (wiki inference).</data>
