    <node id="concept_delirium">
      <data key="d1">Delirium</data>
      <data key="d2">["Delirium (mechanic)"]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Fog of madness released through Mirrors of Delirium that spawns and strengthens monsters and can lead to the Simulacrum. Origin is only hinted: Kalandra links it to 'the Trickster' and PoE2 ties Tangmazu to a tutorial Delirium encounter.</data>
