    <node id="concept_godhood">
      <data key="d1">Nature of godhood (ascension)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d24">cosmology</data>
      <data key="d4">In PoE lore a mortal of rare quality could ascend to godhood on the adoration of their people, shedding mortality; this became impossible once Sin created the Beast. Becoming a god often costs one's humanity. Gods can also be 'made' by belief of followers (Innocence's ascension was fuelled by hatred of Sin).</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d6">background</data>
      <data key="d7">[]</data>
      <data key="d8">primordial</data>
