    <node id="concept_pantheon">
      <data key="d1">The Pantheon</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d24">game_system_as_lore</data>
      <data key="d4">Pantheon power system introduced by Sin after Tukohama's death: Sin captures the souls of the risen gods the exile kills in Part Two and lends the exile a small portion of their power. The Brine King, Arakaali, Solaris and Lunaris grant major god powers; Tukohama, Abberath, Ryslatha, Ralakesh, Gruthkul, Yugul, Garukhan and Shakari are minor gods.</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe1"]</data>
      <data key="d6">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d7">[]</data>
      <data key="d8">poe1_campaign</data>
