      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d24">royal order (legal instrument)</data>
      <data key="d4">A royal order to hang named criminals that was damaged by seawater on the voyage to Kingsmarch; Johan declined to enforce it because the reply would exceed the Charter's statute of limitations and he would not hang the wrong man.</data>
