      <data key="d2">["The Oblivion"]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Ancient cosmic mould-like entity ('the Oblivion') from outside time and space that turns all it touches to void; the Elder is its servant. Dormant after the Elder's defeat.</data>
