    <node id="concept_the_pantheon">
      <data key="d1">The Pantheon (soul-capture mechanic)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d24">mechanic_lore</data>
      <data key="d4">Game mechanic and lore device by which Sin captures the essences of slain gods and grants the Exile a fraction of their powers. Major gods: Brine King, Arakaali, Solaris, Lunaris. Minor gods: Tukohama, Abberath, Ryslatha (Act 6), Gruthkul, Ralakesh (Act 7), Yugul (Act 8), Garukhan, Shakari (Act 9).</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe1"]</data>
      <data key="d6">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d7">["pantheon"]</data>
      <data key="d8">poe1_campaign</data>
