    <node id="concept_the_struggle">
      <data key="d1">The Struggle</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Ancient conflict among cosmic forces (the Decay, the Tangle, the Cleansing Fire) introduced by the Envoy. The forces cannot clash directly without rending reality, so disputes are settled by duels between mortal champions. The Elder's defeat left a vacancy over the Atlas that drew the others in; the Maven, with the Exile as her champion and Kirac's Vanguard, stands against the Eldritch champions. A progenitor/Lightkeeper is cited as the order the forces are blind to.</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe1"]</data>
      <data key="d6">endgame_plot</data>
      <data key="d7">[]</data>
      <data key="d8">poe1_atlas</data>
