    <node id="concept_virtue_gems">
      <data key="d1">Virtue Gems</data>
      <data key="d2">["Tears of Maji", "Tears of the Maji", "Virtue gems"]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Gems from the Beast, the source of thaumaturgy, buried by Veruso and mined by slaves under Chitus; infused into gemlings. Ubiquitous in Vaal society.</data>
