      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">concept</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">In the Viridian Wildwood the four humours (Primal, Vivid, Wild, Sacred) materialise as wisps. The first three share names with Harvest's Primal, Vivid and Wild Lifeforce colours. Sacred humours are harvested by the ritual altars of the King in the Mists.</data>
