    <node id="deity_abberath">
      <data key="d1">Abberath, the Cloven One</data>
      <data key="d2">["Abberath", "The Cloven One"]</data>
      <data key="d3">deity</data>
      <data key="d24">god</data>
      <data key="d4">Goatman god (the Cloven One, Quaffer of Souls) killed in the Valley of the Fire Drinker. Per Bestel, goatmen offer him humans and he eats them 'meat, soul and all'; per Sin he was once Abberath the Scholar King, an alchemist who burned flesh away to drink the life force within, starting with goats. Minor Pantheon god.</data>
