    <node id="deity_innocence">
      <data key="d1">Innocence</data>
      <data key="d2">["God-Emperor of Eternity", "High Templar Avarius (host)", "Maxarius"]</data>
      <data key="d3">deity</data>
      <data key="d4">Templar god of light and purity, twin of Sin; per Lycia's relics his ascension was fuelled by turning followers against Sin. In Act 5 High Templar Avarius is his vessel; after Sin's 'more sensible host' (Bannon) sacrifices himself with the Staff of Purity in Act 10, he is reborn, helps defeat Kitava and then goes into self-exile in the far south.</data>
