      <data key="d1">Ralakesh</data>
      <data key="d2">["Master of a Million Faces", "Ralakesh, Master of a Million Faces"]</data>
      <data key="d3">deity</data>
      <data key="d4">God of subjugation and control, Master of a Million Faces, brother of Tangmazu. Eramir says he ruled a Vaal city and enslaved Azmeri to repopulate it; the God page lists him among Azmerian/Eternal gods. His relic possessed Greust; in the Act 7 quest The Master of a Million Faces the Exile kills Greust and Sin then drains and kills Ralakesh.</data>
