    <node id="event_eater_of_worlds_quest">
      <data key="d1">The Eater of Worlds (quest)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d24">quest</data>
      <data key="d4">Epilogue quest added in 3.17.0 and run in parallel with the Maven and Searing Exarch quests. The Envoy gives the Flesh Compass, which lets the Exile add Eater of Worlds influence to Tier 9 to 16 maps. The Tier 11 map boss drops a Writhing Invitation to the Infinite Hunger's arena (Seething Chyme); the Tier 16 map boss drops a Screaming Invitation to the Eater of Worlds' arena (Absence of Symmetry and Harmony). After The Infinite Hunger is defeated, the Atlas Book of Skill (Eldritch) is obtained; Kirac gives the Grasping Voidstone on completion. The Eater drops an Eldritch Voidstone if The Searing Exarch was defeated first.</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe1"]</data>
      <data key="d6">endgame_plot</data>
      <data key="d7">[]</data>
      <data key="d8">poe1_atlas</data>
