    <node id="event_innocence_true_ascension">
      <data key="d1">Innocence's true ascension (Sanctum relic account)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Lore revealed through Sanctum unique relics: Sin and Innocence were brothers among the Azmeri; Innocence founded a religion on fear of the 'cleansing fire' and the newcomers' symbol, branded Sin the embodiment of sin, and both ascended (Sin ashen, Innocence golden), until the Azmeri drove Innocence's followers off the mountains. Contradicts the Templar 'mother of two' propaganda.</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe1"]</data>
      <data key="d6">background</data>
      <data key="d7">["sanctum"]</data>
