      <data key="d24">tutorial quest (Breach)</data>
      <data key="d4">Act 6 tutorial quest for the Breach mechanic. Ailith's flame burns the Hiveborn barrier at the Mud Flats entrance; the Exile then bonds the Genesis Tree at the Monastery of the Keepers. Introduced in 3.27.0; the 3.28.0 Keepers rework replaced the original Breach mechanic.</data>
