      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Legacy (3.9-3.16) epilogue quests: Kirac enlists the Exile to find his brother Baran, who joined Zana Caeserius's expedition; the Map Device is rebuilt from components in the Vault of Venarius and Zana appears in the Atlas, leading to the Elderslayers/Conquerors storyline. Removed in 3.17.</data>
