    <node id="event_kitava_invited_to_wraeclast">
      <data key="d1">Kitava invited into Wraeclast</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">Karui carvings say the Eternals opened the gate and invited Kitava into the land; Kitava cut the Karui off from the Ancestors. Haku adds that the Karui also had a hand in the downfall.</data>
