    <node id="event_kurai_contract_hyrris_gift">
      <data key="d1">Contract: Hyrri's Gift</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">Kurai's client contract to retrieve 'O' Eternal', the book Victario gifted Queen Hyrri, from an Oriathan nobleman's vault. The Exile completes the theft; Kurai then promises to return the book to Ngamakanui. The theft leads to Vic Vox's grievance against Kurai.</data>
