    <node id="event_kurai_contract_the_negotiation">
      <data key="d1">Contract: The Negotiation</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">Kurai and the Exile travel to meet the Vox twins over the stolen 'O' Eternal. Kurai says the book is no longer in her possession; Vic Vox declares war on her and the meeting ends with the Vox twins at war with Kurai. Hana, Kurai's cat, is taken afterwards.</data>
