    <node id="event_kurai_contract_the_rescue">
      <data key="d1">Contract: The Rescue</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">The Vox twins offer to return Hana and negotiate a truce if Kurai and the Exile meet them in person again. The second meeting ends in hostility (Kurai's counter-proposal is to kill both twins); afterwards Kurai learns the Vox twins killed Hana, and The Boss orders the Vox family dead.</data>
