      <data key="d4">Final contract of Kurai's questline (unique, tradeable, restartable): Kurai and the Exile strike the Vox twins after Ring intelligence that the twins will unite for a celebration, and kill Vic Vox and Vinny Vox at the Mansion. The Boss authorises a bonus for the Exile.</data>
