      <data key="d4">Kurai's first job for the Ring in the Rogue Harbour introductory quest: after Kurai hands out the contract the Exile speaks to the rogue Karst, opens a portal to the contract zone via Adiyah, completes the contract and sells the Heist target to Faustus. Kurai is first accessible in Act 6 from patch 3.13.0.</data>
