    <node id="event_order_of_djinn_forsake_kalandra">
      <data key="d1">Order of the Djinn Forsake Kalandra</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">The Order of the Djinn swears to free Kalandra and devotes itself to her artefacts of power, but 'once they understood the truth of this place' its scribes try to erase her from history, burning their books (Kalandra page: and self-immolating out of fear); the History page words it as forsaking and abandoning her.</data>
