    <node id="event_poe1_a6_kill_tukohama">
      <data key="d1">The Father of War</data>
      <data key="d2">["The Exile Kills Tukohama"]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">Required Act 6 quest. The Exile finds the missing Eye of Conquest (from the Dishonoured Queen), enters the Karui Fortress and Tukohama's Keep, and kills Tukohama, the Karui god of war. Sin then introduces the Pantheon. The quest completes when Tarkleigh rewards the Exile in Lioneye's Watch.</data>
