    <node id="event_poe1_a7_master_of_a_million_faces">
      <data key="d1">The Master of a Million Faces</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">Required Act 7 quest. Eramir reads the Vaal inscriptions on the relic that washed ashore and identifies the god Ralakesh. Ralakesh has possessed Greust; killing Greust forces the god back into the relic, and destroying the relic may destroy the god. The route to the Old Fields runs through a secret passage from the Chamber of Sins, whose key Silk gives after Maligaro's map boss.</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe1"]</data>
      <data key="d6">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d7">[]</data>
      <data key="d8">poe1_campaign</data>
