    <node id="event_poe1_a9_recurring_nightmare">
      <data key="d1">Recurring Nightmare</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">Required Act 9 quest. Sin asks the Exile to gather Basilisk Acid and Trarthan Powder (Refinery, Boiling Lake) so he can burn a new entrance into the Beast. The Exile meets Sin at the Quarry, enters the Belly of the Beast, and kills the Depraved Trinity; Lilly Roth then offers to ferry the Exile to Oriath for Act 10.</data>
