      <data key="d4">Optional Act 9 quest. Kira has kidnapped Oyun to sacrifice her to Garukhan. The Exile kills Kira and Garukhan but cannot save Oyun; the Sekhema Feather is then given to Tasuni or Irasha (the Exile's choice), who rules Highgate. The reward is a Book of Skill.</data>
