      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">Final Atlas quest given by Zana in the epilogue. The Exile spreads Elder influence to the four Tier 16 Shaper Guardian maps so the Elder spawns in the Shaper's Realm, then defeats the Elder Guardians and the Uber Elder. Removed from the game in 3.9.0 when the Atlas mechanic was reworked (introduced 3.2.0).</data>
