    <node id="event_poe1_epilogue_oriath_kirac">
      <data key="d1">Oriath after Kitava (older Epilogue, v3.9-3.16)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Historical content (removed in 3.17): in the earlier Epilogue the exile talks to Officer Kirac in rebuilding Oriath, who asks them to investigate his brother Baran's disappearance and Zana at the Templar Laboratory, leading to the Vault of Venarius and a rebuilt Map Device. Kitava's skull is displayed in Oriath (Epilogue).</data>
