      <data key="d1">The Sacred Grove (quest)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">Introductory quest for the Harvest mechanic. After the Exile finds the Sacred Grove, Oshabi teaches the Exile to harvest the Grove's seeds (Wild, Vivid and Primal Lifeforce pools), kill the monsters that emerge, and talk to her about the harvest. Reworked in 3.13.0.</data>
