    <node id="event_poe1_epilogue_the_memory_eater">
      <data key="d1">The Memory Eater</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">Epilogue quest given by Zana. The Exile must collect 15 Memory Fragments by killing the bosses of Elder-influenced Atlas maps; each fragment can be exchanged for a Shaper's Orb, and each turn-in earns Zana reputation, and fragments II to X also earn a map of the same tier as the fragment. Removed in 3.9.0.</data>
