    <node id="event_poe1_epilogue_the_redeemer">
      <data key="d1">The Redeemer (quest)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">Epilogue Atlas quest in which Zana's former colleague Veritania has gone insane and lurks in corner-region maps of the Atlas. The Exile finds her three times, then uses Kirac's information and Zana's portals to enter her Citadel and defeat Veritania the Redeemer. Reworked for 3.16 when the Atlas was reduced to four regions; removed in 3.17.</data>
