    <node id="event_purity_rebellion">
      <data key="d1">Purity Rebellion</data>
      <data key="d2">["The Purity Rebellion"]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d24">rebellion</data>
      <data key="d4">A rebellion led by High Templar Voll and the poet Victario, with King Kaom, Sekhema Deshret and Thane Rigwald. It culminates in the siege of Sarn (Divini, 1334 IC) and Voll's coronation.</data>
