    <node id="event_red_communion">
      <data key="d1">The Red Communion</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Project that allowed Atziri to commune directly with the Beast. Doryani, privately opposed, was forced to devise it; he learned all he could and prepared contingencies. It triggered the Vaal Cataclysm.</data>
