      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d4">Sin's Beast lulled the gods into dreamless slumber, ending an era of divine strife; Hinekora foresaw it and prepared the Halls of the Dead before sleeping.</data>
