    <node id="event_the_mavens_game">
      <data key="d1">The Maven's Game (quest)</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d24">quest</data>
      <data key="d4">Epilogue quest that starts when the Exile enters Absence of Mercy and Empathy with a Maven's Writ; it culminates in the Maven pinnacle boss fight. Defeating the Maven unlocks the Ceremonial Voidstone (reported to Commander Kirac); the quest's final steps have the Exile use an Atlas Book of Skill for 1 Atlas passive skill point and 2 Atlas passive respec points.</data>
