    <node id="event_vaal_cataclysm">
      <data key="d1">Vaal Cataclysm</data>
      <data key="d2">["The Fall", "The Fall of the Vaal"]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Event c. 400 BIC that ended the Vaal Empire: Doryani's project to grant immortality (manipulating the Beast, corruption, gems, sacrifice and 'communion') went wrong; only 3,126 Vaal survived and took refuge with the Azmeri. PoE2 shows the Red Communion and Atziri being swallowed by the Beast.</data>
