      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">event</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">The 3,126 surviving Vaal found refuge among the Azmeri, could not explain what happened, had no gems and assimilated until none remained; they panicked at an image of a gem shown by the Kalguur.</data>
