      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d4">Assassins-for-hire based primarily in Sarn, also called the Silent Brotherhood. The wiki says it acted as a hit squad for many of the Eternal Empire's elite (business with Cadiro and the Perandus family), framed Jorgin for his brother's death so he was exiled from Ogham, and surrounded Drusus in the Bath House until he drowned himself. Listed members: Shadow (former), Coralito and Vorici.</data>
