    <node id="faction_immortal_syndicate">
      <data key="d1">The Immortal Syndicate</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Group of resurrected criminals and the missing forsaken masters under Catarina (the Mastermind), with 17 other members in four divisions (Transportation, Fortification, Research, Intervention); aims to become the ruling power in Wraeclast. Jun believes (not confirmed) the Horns of Kulamac give them their return-from-death ability.</data>
