    <node id="faction_keepers_of_the_flame">
      <data key="d1">Keepers of the Flame (Order of the Purple Flame)</data>
      <data key="d2">["Keepers of the Flame"]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Monastic order founded by Ailith after her visions of the Dreamer; they train in the Monastery to defend Wraeclast against the Hiveborn and tend the Genesis Tree. The PoE2 wiki calls it the Order of the Purple Flame; the Monk class belongs to it. It is a taboo among them to speak the Dreamer's true name (Chayula).</data>
