    <node id="faction_order_of_the_djinn">
      <data key="d1">Order of the Djinn</data>
      <data key="d2">["Djinn"]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Secret society founded in ancient times by the Maraketh and the Clayshaper (Ahkeli) that protects Wraeclast from calamity and guards dangerous artefacts (Forbidden Vaults near the Oasis, Act 9); takes one orphan from each culture. Members forged and delivered the Starforge to the Watchers of Decay (video). Janus Perandus's betrayal let Catarina raid the vault and the Order was slain except Jun and Janus; in PoE2 Jun is rebuilding it. Past members include Ixchel (later the Trialmaster).</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe1", "poe2"]</data>
      <data key="d6">main_plot</data>
      <data key="d7">["betrayal", "kalandra", "mirage"]</data>
      <data key="d8">azmeri_ezomyte_ancient</data>
      <data key="d9">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": null, "story_order": null}</data>
      <data key="d10">["act_poe2_interlude2"]</data>
      <data key="d11">canon</data>
      <data key="d12">high</data>
      <data key="d13">[{"source_id": "src_poewiki_order_of_the_djinn", "locator": "lead paragraph and 'Historical members'"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_icius_perandus", "locator": "'Lore'"}, {"source_id": "src_yt_6tP4TcFw4Lo", "locator": "1:07 order of the Djinn; 16:34 Starforge; 20:10 infiltration of Forbidden Vault"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_order_of_the_djinn", "locator": "page"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_order_of_the_djinn", "locator": "Members / Jun rebuilding"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_order_of_the_djinn", "locator": "lead and Members"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_order_of_the_djinn", "locator": "intro"}, {"source_id": "src_poewiki_order_of_the_djinn", "locator": "lead; Members"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_order_of_the_djinn", "locator": "PoE2 page"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_recruit_the_maraketh", "locator": "Jado dialogue"}, {"source_id": "src_poe2wiki_order_of_the_djinn", "locator": "lead"}]</data>
      <data key="d14">["eternal_empire", "leagues_early", "leagues_late", "leagues_mid", "poe2_acts_4_plus", "poe2_endgame"]</data>
      <data key="d15">["azmeri_ezomyte_ancient", "post_cataclysm", "poe1_leagues", "poe2_campaign"]</data>
      <data key="d16">["main_plot", "background"]</data>
      <data key="d25">[{"domain": "eternal_empire", "summary": "Secret society founded by the Maraketh and the Clayshaper to protect Wraeclast from calamity and guard dangerous artefacts. Icius Perandus and, much later, Janus Perandus belonged to it."}, {"domain": "leagues_late", "summary": "Secret society founded by the Maraketh and the Clayshaper to protect Wraeclast from calamities; Jun is rebuilding it in PoE2."}, {"domain": "leagues_mid", "summary": "Secret society founded by the Maraketh and the Clayshaper that guards dangerous artefacts and prevents calamities; selects one orphan from each culture. Members include Jun, Janus Perandus, Saresh, Ixchel, Dhunan, Sumei (investigated Kalandra's duplication of artefacts). Jun is rebuilding it in PoE2."}, {"domain": "poe2_acts_4_plus", "summary": "Secret order (Jado's) replenishing its ranks; Jado confirms they infiltrated the Sel Khari and will be in Oriath."}, {"domain": "poe2_endgame", "summary": "Secret order founded by the Maraketh to guard relics and protect Wraeclast; nearly destroyed by Janus's betrayal in PoE1's Betrayal; Jun rebuilds it in secret, per PoE2."}]</data>
      <data key="d18">released</data>
      <data key="d19">24</data>
