    <node id="faction_perandus_family">
      <data key="d1">Perandus family</data>
      <data key="d2">["House Perandus"]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Wealthiest merchant-lender family of the Eternal Empire (motto 'With piety and justice'). Blocked from the throne by the Phrecians, they rigged Izaro's Labyrinth so Chitus Perandus won; Cadiro looted the treasury before the fall. Descendants include Syndicate member Janus Perandus.</data>
