      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Unbroken line of emperors descended from Alano Phrecia, who founded the line after killing the 'dark being' in 35 IC. It ran from Alano through Romira and Tyndarus to Izaro, who was childless.</data>
