    <node id="faction_three_sisters">
      <data key="d1">The Three Sisters</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">faction</data>
      <data key="d4">Cross-cultural myth of the sun, moon and earth sisters who destroyed Kulemak's mortal form and ended the Winter of the World; named differently by Eternals, Maraketh, Karui, Azmeri and the Wildwood Draiocht (Catha, Mhacha, Morrigan).</data>
