    <node id="loc_oriath">
      <data key="d1">Oriath</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">location</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Island off the south-east of Wraeclast, founded by Innocence's banished followers and ruled by the Templar theocracy from Theopolis. Unaffected by the Cataclysm, it served as the Empire's successor; destroyed in the Atlas storyline of PoE1 and revisited in PoE2 Act 4.</data>
