      <data key="d25">[{"domain": "exile_and_sources", "summary": "A small island off Wraeclast's south-east coast, founded by followers of Innocence. Unaffected by the Cataclysm, it became the successor of the Eternal Empire and a Templar theocracy."}, {"domain": "poe1_acts_1_5", "summary": "Island Theocracy ruled by the Templar."}, {"domain": "poe1_acts_6_10", "summary": "Capital of the Templar Theocracy; fallen to Kitava's cultists, revisited in Act 10 and rebuilt in the Epilogue."}, {"domain": "poe2_acts_4_plus", "summary": "Former Templar capital destroyed by Sirus in PoE1; PoE2 outsiders think it was abandoned 20 years ago, but the Twilight Order secretly rebuilt its heart and keeps the Beast here (Kanu, Act 4). Setting of the unreleased Act 5."}]</data>
