    <node id="text_aberrations">
      <data key="d1">Aberrations</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">text</data>
      <data key="d4">Environmental lore objects tied to the Originator (Zana) and her father Valdo. Most entries are narrated by Zana: the Atlas as a trap, Sirus's transformation by the Atlas, her intervention through memory threads to save him, and the Templars' brutality. The entries in the Incarnation boss arenas are narrated by Valdo.</data>
