      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">text</data>
      <data key="d4">Four clickable hunter's journals from Al-Hezmin's arena. They are notes on his companions (Baran's prayers, Veritania's reading, Zana's secrets, Drox's drills), his rivalry with Drox, and a final entry about a 'New Person' who talked with Zana and seemed stronger than the other exiles.</data>
