    <node id="text_baran_journals">
      <data key="d1">Baran's Journals</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">text</data>
      <data key="d4">Four clickable journals from Baran's arena: a will bequeathing his staff and platemail to Veritania, Sirus, Drox and Al-Hezmin and his Oriathan home to Templar siblings; a letter to Landren about being trapped in the Atlas; a letter to a discoverer describing the demon that fed on Valdo Caeserius's memories ('the Decay') and Sirus's sacrifice; and a final entry in which Baran turns to God and plans to take the Atlas.</data>
