    <node id="text_word_of_the_dreamer">
      <data key="d1">The Word of the Dreamer</data>
      <data key="d2">[]</data>
      <data key="d3">text</data>
      <data key="d24" />
      <data key="d4">Environmental-lore book in the Monastery of the Keepers written by Ailith recording five visions of the Dreamer. Four visions warn of the Mother (births flesh), the Red Pyre (flame/addiction), the Forked Psyche (thought without will) and the Preserved Patterns (imprisoned bodies), each of whom the Dreamer 'once knew'; the fifth says the Four have become One and that the Genesis Tree is his gift. The mapping of these four to Uul-Netol (flesh), Xoph (fire), Esh (forked thought) and Tul (preserved/frozen) is inference from epithets and the wiki's note that the book is about the four Breachlords that became Xesht.</data>
      <data key="d5">["poe1"]</data>
      <data key="d6">branch</data>
      <data key="d7">["breach", "keepers_of_the_flame"]</data>
      <data key="d8">poe1_leagues</data>
      <data key="d9">{"in_world_year": null, "relative": null, "story_order": null}</data>
      <data key="d10">[]</data>
