      <data key="d30">e_char_dominus__exiles__char_class_ranger</data>
      <data key="d31">exiles</data>
      <data key="d32">Dominus's character-creation speech: 'Swift and silent you stole the bounty of others.' The Ranger's legacy text says Oriath called her a 'poacher' and 'thief' and hauled her 'like cargo into exile' (the stated grievance is poaching).</data>
      <data key="d33">["poe1"]</data>
