      <data key="d30">e_char_dominus__exiles__char_class_shadow</data>
      <data key="d31">exiles</data>
      <data key="d32">Dominus's character-creation speech: 'Yours is a predatory profession. The business of butchery.' The Shadow's legacy text describes a contract killing ('Silence a big mouth'); the employers toasted the job and the Shadow was shipped into exile.</data>
