    <edge source="char_dominus" target="char_class_witch" id="e_char_dominus__exiles__char_class_witch">
      <data key="d30">e_char_dominus__exiles__char_class_witch</data>
      <data key="d31">exiles</data>
      <data key="d32">Dominus's character-creation speech: 'When a Daughter strays away from the Light, she makes herself an Orphan.' The Witch's legacy text: 'Had they not taken my home with fire, I would not have taken their children.' The stated act is taking children; no formal charge is named.</data>
      <data key="d33">["poe1"]</data>
      <data key="d34">main_plot</data>
